{
    "title": "KidsGuard Pro-Phone Monitoring",
    "description": "\ud83e\udd14Are you worried about your kid's online activities?\r\n\ud83d\ude14Does your child have suffered online bullying, self-harm, suicide, anxiety, depression, etc.?\r\n\ud83d\ude42Do you want a comprehensive, easy-to-use parental control app to protect your kids?\r\n\r\nTry <b>KidsGuard Pro</b>! The ultimate remote monitoring app and cell phone tracker to keep an eye on your child [Android & iPhone available]\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83d\udc66\u200d\ud83d\udc66\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf89So why wait? Download KidsGuard Pro - The best phone monitoring app to protect your child's physical and mental growth in all aspects!!!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd25<b>Hottest Functions:</b>\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc9b<b>View TikTok & YouTube History</b>\r\n-View kids' TikTok and YouTube history\r\n-Track how much time kids spend on TikTok & YouTube\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc99<b>Suspicious Text Detection</b>\r\n-Setting sensitive keywords you are concerned about, like sex, violence, or drugs\r\n-Detect WhatsApp, LINE, Viber, Kik chat history, WeChat, YouTube, Facebook, Instagram, and QQ, as well as exchanged media files, emojis, and more\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udda4<b>Real-time Location Tracker</b>\r\n-Always be aware of your kids' whereabouts. You can track the real-time location of your kids 24/7\r\n-Set up geofences to receive immediate alerts when they enter or leave home, school, or any other specific area\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udde1<b>Identify Most Models</b>\r\n-Supervise and control most Samsung, Xiaomi, Motorola, and hundreds of other Android models\r\n-Keep track of smartphone activities all day long\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udd0e<b>Instant Screenshot and Record Screen</b>\r\n-Take a screenshot or record the screen remotely with one tap\r\n-Protect your children's online activities in real time, making knowing them easier\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc9a<b>Thorough Usage Report</b>\r\n-The detailed usage report delivers a thorough overview of how your kids use their devices daily\r\n-You can know what actions to take to ensure your child is safer when using the device\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd25KidsGuard Pro-Phone Monitoring\ud83d\udd25 is your most reliable screen time and location tracker, with features like the device's screen time control & location track, TikTok history check, detailed activity report, suspicious photos & text detection on social media apps like WhatsApp, LINE, Viber, Kik chat history, WeChat, YouTube, Facebook, Instagram, and QQ, as well as exchanged media files, emojis and more.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\ude32<b>Why Do You Need the KidsGuard Pro-Phone Monitoring?</b>\r\n\r\nThe ultimate parental control app to keep an eye on loved ones:\r\n\u2022 \ud83d\udcf1 Read text messages and check WhatsApp, Snapchat, Discord chats, etc.\r\n\u2022 \ud83d\udccd Track mobile locations to know where and where they've been.\r\n\u2022\ud83d\udcdeCheck call history to find out who they call and meet.\r\n\u2022\ud83d\udd0aRecord phone calls, screens, and surroundings without knowing.\r\n\u2022\ud83d\udd0dCheck search history and keystrokes to know all kids' online activities.\r\n\u2022\ud83d\udd35Set up keywords and get alerts instantly when kids type sensitive content.\r\n\u2022\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f100% safe & undetectable. There is no need to root or jailbreak the target Android or iPhone devices.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udca1\ud83d\udca1<b>How do I start monitoring someone's phone with the best cell phone tracker now? Find out how to monitor any device you want with KidsGuard Pro!</b>\r\nStep1\ufe0f\u20e3-Install KidsGuard Pro on Your Phone\r\nStep2\ufe0f\u20e3-Sign up KidsGuard Pro account and get your VIP benefits\r\nStep3\ufe0f\u20e3-Download and install KidsGuard Pro Assistant on the target device\r\nStep4\ufe0f\u20e3-Remotely start monitoring and parental control\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf0d<b>ABOUT THE DEVELOPER</b>\r\nClevGuard is a global leader in application software development. Top software owned by ClevGuard, such as KidsGuard for WA-Chat Tracker and ClevGuard-AntiSpyware, is used in more than 150 countries worldwide, with more than one million monthly active users.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udce3If you think KidsGuard Pro is a perfect control app, please share this most comprehensive and award-winning parental control app with your friends! \ud83c\udf08\ud83c\udf08\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udce7If you have any questions or need technical support, don't hesitate to get in touch with us via email: support@clevguard.com\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf10For more information, please visit our website: https://www.clevguard.com\r\n\ud83d\udcdcTo learn more about our privacy policy: https://www.clevguard.com/privacy-policy/",
    "descriptionHTML": "\ud83e\udd14Are you worried about your kid&#39;s online activities?<br>\ud83d\ude14Does your child have suffered online bullying, self-harm, suicide, anxiety, depression, etc.?<br>\ud83d\ude42Do you want a comprehensive, easy-to-use parental control app to protect your kids?<br><br>Try <b>KidsGuard Pro</b>! The ultimate remote monitoring app and cell phone tracker to keep an eye on your child [Android &amp; iPhone available]\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83d\udc66\u200d\ud83d\udc66<br><br>\ud83c\udf89So why wait? Download KidsGuard Pro - The best phone monitoring app to protect your child&#39;s physical and mental growth in all aspects!!!<br><br>\ud83d\udd25<b>Hottest Functions:</b><br><br>\ud83d\udc9b<b>View TikTok &amp; YouTube History</b><br>-View kids&#39; TikTok and YouTube history<br>-Track how much time kids spend on TikTok &amp; YouTube<br><br>\ud83d\udc99<b>Suspicious Text Detection</b><br>-Setting sensitive keywords you are concerned about, like sex, violence, or drugs<br>-Detect WhatsApp, LINE, Viber, Kik chat history, WeChat, YouTube, Facebook, Instagram, and QQ, as well as exchanged media files, emojis, and more<br><br>\ud83d\udda4<b>Real-time Location Tracker</b><br>-Always be aware of your kids&#39; whereabouts. You can track the real-time location of your kids 24/7<br>-Set up geofences to receive immediate alerts when they enter or leave home, school, or any other specific area<br><br>\ud83e\udde1<b>Identify Most Models</b><br>-Supervise and control most Samsung, Xiaomi, Motorola, and hundreds of other Android models<br>-Keep track of smartphone activities all day long<br><br>\ud83e\udd0e<b>Instant Screenshot and Record Screen</b><br>-Take a screenshot or record the screen remotely with one tap<br>-Protect your children&#39;s online activities in real time, making knowing them easier<br><br>\ud83d\udc9a<b>Thorough Usage Report</b><br>-The detailed usage report delivers a thorough overview of how your kids use their devices daily<br>-You can know what actions to take to ensure your child is safer when using the device<br><br>\ud83d\udd25KidsGuard Pro-Phone Monitoring\ud83d\udd25 is your most reliable screen time and location tracker, with features like the device&#39;s screen time control &amp; location track, TikTok history check, detailed activity report, suspicious photos &amp; text detection on social media apps like WhatsApp, LINE, Viber, Kik chat history, WeChat, YouTube, Facebook, Instagram, and QQ, as well as exchanged media files, emojis and more.<br><br>\ud83d\ude32<b>Why Do You Need the KidsGuard Pro-Phone Monitoring?</b><br><br>The ultimate parental control app to keep an eye on loved ones:<br>\u2022 \ud83d\udcf1 Read text messages and check WhatsApp, Snapchat, Discord chats, etc.<br>\u2022 \ud83d\udccd Track mobile locations to know where and where they&#39;ve been.<br>\u2022\ud83d\udcdeCheck call history to find out who they call and meet.<br>\u2022\ud83d\udd0aRecord phone calls, screens, and surroundings without knowing.<br>\u2022\ud83d\udd0dCheck search history and keystrokes to know all kids&#39; online activities.<br>\u2022\ud83d\udd35Set up keywords and get alerts instantly when kids type sensitive content.<br>\u2022\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f100% safe &amp; undetectable. There is no need to root or jailbreak the target Android or iPhone devices.<br><br>\ud83d\udca1\ud83d\udca1<b>How do I start monitoring someone&#39;s phone with the best cell phone tracker now? Find out how to monitor any device you want with KidsGuard Pro!</b><br>Step1\ufe0f\u20e3-Install KidsGuard Pro on Your Phone<br>Step2\ufe0f\u20e3-Sign up KidsGuard Pro account and get your VIP benefits<br>Step3\ufe0f\u20e3-Download and install KidsGuard Pro Assistant on the target device<br>Step4\ufe0f\u20e3-Remotely start monitoring and parental control<br><br>\ud83c\udf0d<b>ABOUT THE DEVELOPER</b><br>ClevGuard is a global leader in application software development. Top software owned by ClevGuard, such as KidsGuard for WA-Chat Tracker and ClevGuard-AntiSpyware, is used in more than 150 countries worldwide, with more than one million monthly active users.<br><br>\ud83d\udce3If you think KidsGuard Pro is a perfect control app, please share this most comprehensive and award-winning parental control app with your friends! \ud83c\udf08\ud83c\udf08<br><br>\ud83d\udce7If you have any questions or need technical support, don&#39;t hesitate to get in touch with us via email: support@clevguard.com<br><br>\ud83c\udf10For more information, please visit our website: https://www.clevguard.com<br>\ud83d\udcdcTo learn more about our privacy policy: https://www.clevguard.com/privacy-policy/",
